IN THEIR OWN WORDS. 🎙️

The artists behind El Fell Journey EP (FBRK001) share a few words about their tracks and what this release means to them.

For us, this EP is much more than just a record. It’s a little piece of Fabrika’s story, pressed on vinyl.

We named it after El Fell, the hotel that was home to Fabrika Festival for over seven years. A place filled with music, friendships, unforgettable moments and so many memories. ❤️ As one chapter comes to an end and a new one begins, we wanted to keep a little piece of it with us.

Over the years, Fabrika has brought so many people together. Some of the artists on this record actually met at the festival and ended up making music together. Others have been coming back year after year, sharing the decks, long nights, good times and everything in between.

And that’s what makes this first release so special to us. It’s not just about the tracks. It’s about the people behind them, the friendships that grew along the way, and all those connections that started with a shared love for music. 🫶

Seeing it all come together on our first vinyl means a lot to us.

A little piece of Fabrika history, and the beginning of a new adventure. ✨

El Fell Journey EP — FBRK001

Out now — Order via Yoyaku, link in bio.

